00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.950
associated with that register with the

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.550
the flip-flops if you want.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.710
Um and then of course the outputs will

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.870
