00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:55.630
um

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:58.150
it's quite often we will mark them with

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:01.510
an arrow where we start from this

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:03.790
the enabling signal and the triggering

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.990
signal and then mark what that causes to

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.790
change. And that can make them much

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.350
easier to read. So, here you'll see I've

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:11.390
shown the clock edge

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.750
uh changing this output because uh

