uh C 2 and and then here I've shown that

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:19.310
the the input changing right because

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.710
this is an immediate output changes this

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:25.430
edge of the output. So, this is Z of L.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:28.030
Uh we're in state A uh, and that means

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.430
that uh, this output is conditional on

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:32.670
Z, which is active low, so it goes low

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:34.830
when that changes.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.910
But it goes high again on the next clock

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.790
edge, and so we've shown shown that

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:42.230
